   "en": "Back foot turned out, so the calf loses the stretch."
  }
 ],
 "cautions": [
  {
   "zh": "跟腱或小腿刺疼就少往前靠一点",
   "en": "If your Achilles or calf gets a sharp pain, lean in less."
  }
